   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "The rabbi telling Anthropic that he thinks what they’re doing is fine, because Claude is just a machine to him, but if they’re right (and it is conscious), then they’re world historic monsters, is really interesting.",
   "handle": "opinionhaver.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "William B. Fuckley",
   "likes": 670,
   "reposts": 56,
   "replies": 20,
   "created_at": "2026-10-02T21:44:36.808Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/opinionhaver.bsky.social/post/3mwwds6wne225",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Biden administration, l led the team that developed what was arguably the first White House “AI safety” framework, the AI Bill of Rights. \n\nDavid Robinson, author of this forthright and sobering essay about risk culture at OpenAI and in Silicon Valley was on that team.",
   "handle": "alondra.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Alondra Nelson",
   "likes": 372,
   "reposts": 168,
   "replies": 10,
   "created_at": "2026-10-03T13:19:24.261Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/alondra.bsky.social/post/3mwxxzq3zkk2u",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "AI safety"
  },
  {
   "text": "This is bad journalism.\n\nIt cannot be overstated how much harm has been caused by lumping \"LLM driven toxic bullshit\" in with the traditional understanding of AI as a computer science discipline.\n\nThe tools and techniques described in this article have nothing to do with LLM-based systems.",
   "handle": "lyses-good-boy.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Seven Eagles, Lyse Kisser",
   "likes": 358,
   "reposts": 171,
   "replies": 5,
   "created_at": "2026-10-03T15:48:56.239Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lyses-good-boy.bsky.social/post/3mwyaf4gvws2g",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "Personally I’m starting to doubt the consciousness of people who work for Anthropic",
   "handle": "gianmarcosoresi.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Gianmarco Soresi",
   "likes": 492,
   "reposts": 36,
   "replies": 8,
   "created_at": "2026-10-03T14:08:02.243Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/gianmarcosoresi.bsky.social/post/3mwy2qovmhs2p",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "Allowing Open AI to call these “rogue agents” lets them dodge responsibility - they made them, directed them and set them free without caring about the consequences. Our laws need to catch up to hold them accountable before worse happens.",
   "handle": "davidshoebridge.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Senator David Shoebridge",
   "likes": 315,
   "reposts": 114,
   "replies": 17,
