   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the \"I left $AILab for ethical reasons\" grift is starting up:\n\nI understand wanting that bag, wanting to be in on a big thing. But if you thought OpenAI or Anthropic were okay a year ago or so, I really am not willing to give you any credit for leaving now.",
